# EVM RPC endpoint for reading ERC-8004 registry logs (Base Sepolia).
# Defaults to the public node (https://sepolia.base.org), which rate-limits eth_getLogs.
# Set a paid endpoint (Alchemy, Infura, etc.) to avoid "-32016 over rate limit" errors.
VITE_RPC_URL=

# marketplace-service base URL (packages/marketplace-service). Its indexer serves each agent's
# reputation, shown on agent cards. Optional: unset hides reputation. The service must allow this
# dashboard's origin (CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS, default *). e.g. http://localhost:3100
VITE_MARKETPLACE_SERVICE_URL=
